### Cash flow report - default current month to date
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/cash-flow/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Cash flow report - selected period
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/cash-flow/?date_from=2026-04-01&date_to=2026-04-30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Search/select bank account
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/cash-flow/?date_from=2026-04-01&date_to=2026-04-30&search=Main&bank_account_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

